, cultural, and disability rights"}, {"id": "84cb57c1-4583-4b6f-a582-0dcf9e7b3ce5", "type": "concept", "title": "Distribution, recognition, participation, and repair"}, {"id": "e2ac89c0-4fe4-4955-940b-10bbe5bedc90", "type": "concept", "title": "Intergenerational and environmental justice"}], "description": "The point is linking local practice to social, racial, economic, and environmental justice."}, {"id": "5e8c8cfb-2638-4103-8233-9b2810d6900d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Anti-oppressive accountability", "children": [{"id": "36d9a844-10be-4749-841b-c4dd00ca8885", "type": "concept", "title": "Community expertise and shared power"}, {"id": "630eff47-5f76-4e82-9471-b374824b6e57", "type": "concept", "title": "Language access, accessibility, and compensation"}, {"id": "16ef3dfb-e07b-4c95-8f40-3a4ac20270ca", "type": "concept", "title": "Data harm, surveillance, retaliation, and do-no-harm planning"}], "description": "Students avoid extractive or savior-oriented practice."}]}, {"id": "564c4b81-8ed0-4ef7-965a-09e42cc3a05f", "type": "topic", "title": "Community Engagement and Relationship Building", "description": "Build trust and reciprocal relationships before defining problems or proposing interventions.", "children": [{"id": "986e0705-0b1b-4a32-9da9-00cb8653ba32", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Entry and presence", "children": [{"id": "07f6e298-9858-4681-b1e5-f87de9c4ce7f", "type": "concept", "title": "Stakeholder permission and introductions"}, {"id": "eaadf242-ffa4-42c4-b890-bea66958ae65", "type": "concept", "title": "History, prior harms, expectations, and readiness"}, {"id": "5e6336c6-b642-481f-a079-580daba87fcc", "type": "concept", "title": "Reliability, listening, reciprocity, and visibility"}], "description": "Students learn respectful entry into communities and organizations."}, {"id": "5f81e5ea-20af-41ac-b0b8-397ad68fd342", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Engagement methods", "children": [{"id": "63fb644f-4bf9-4475-b42b-b1bac19d103c", "type": "concept", "title": "One-to-one conversations, listening sessions, town halls, and outreach"}, {"id": "6dadd6ae-d358-428c-80bd-4161b2899fcc", "type": "concept", "title": "Language, disability, schedule, childcare, transport, and digital access"}, {"id": "a4497fd1-32ed-4fb4-86c7-7d518a343d68", "type": "concept", "title": "Reaching excluded and less-visible constituencies"}], "description": "The goal is broad and meaningful participation."}, {"id": "d824098a-1a3f-4791-968f-111dc10842bb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Trust and conflict", "children": [{"id": "dc525523-2be6-461f-87ef-50474ab09f30", "type": "concept", "title": "Trauma-informed and culturally responsive engagement"}, {"id": "d324a749-ee09-4f60-9a4d-3464d9770ebf", "type": "concept", "title": "Repair, apology, confidentiality, and rumor response"}, {"id": "4bb432d9-73db-4060-bd7a-9459614db00e", "type": "concept", "title": "Boundaries, safety, and exit/transition planning"}], "description": "Students sustain relationships amid disagreement."}]}, {"id": "5cfc44b6-254e-4dcb-b7f7-90eea4d1071a", "type": "topic", "title": "Participatory Community Assessment and Asset Mapping", "description": "Co-produce an evidence-rich understanding of community strengths, priorities, inequities, and opportunities.", "children": [{"id": "2ad76bc0-52b9-44fe-b62d-2eb8e1b70ae3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Assessment design", "children": [{"id": "24d4c540-8b31-4da4-9340-ab4721de5fe0", "type": "concept", "title": "Community-defined questions and indicators"}, {"id": "40c706dd-a09b-441e-9d21-871c76182957", "type": "concept", "title": "Assets, needs, risks, protective factors, and history"}, {"id": "3e64a6ad-31b0-4b98-8b8f-43f7e0862307", "type": "concept", "title": "Sampling, inclusion, consent, and ethics"}], "description": "Students clarify purpose, users, questions, and decision points."}, {"id": "6a51247c-46ab-45e3-8b43-41bd89af501a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Methods and data", "children": [{"id": "d5509ebb-d90d-4519-b8cb-59c4f2dd5732", "typ