ional intelligence and use of self"}, {"id": "ba8ca358-adbb-4716-b8dd-ef64c3eee9c0", "type": "concept", "title": "Power sharing and constituent leadership"}], "description": "Students distinguish authority from leadership."}, {"id": "2ac8a9e7-1a52-4a7a-8210-000b08bdc7ed", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Meetings and facilitation", "children": [{"id": "1e0a0acd-badb-4607-8699-3a52b8c38ff6", "type": "concept", "title": "Purpose, agenda, norms, roles, and decisions"}, {"id": "b5acb110-e34a-438b-bea3-f4613881f614", "type": "concept", "title": "Participation, accessibility, language, conflict, and difficult dynamics"}, {"id": "3cebc8d1-d1ca-4ad9-ba8b-eb40c3d84241", "type": "concept", "title": "Documentation, action tracking, and evaluation"}], "description": "The goal is inclusive, productive group process."}, {"id": "bc4887a5-789d-421d-8f32-59d4e0513692", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Supervision and development", "children": [{"id": "cd36962a-db60-4acf-942e-fc666429aaea", "type": "concept", "title": "Clear expectations and feedback"}, {"id": "73d1dc17-20de-4a79-9d1f-b104d32eccb3", "type": "concept", "title": "Coaching, delegation, performance, and accountability"}, {"id": "7b00c982-cdc5-41d5-b1dd-85447ea8a07a", "type": "concept", "title": "Burnout prevention, boundaries, and referral for support"}], "description": "Students understand foundational administrative, educational, and supportive functions."}]}, {"id": "5a83e376-f0d5-41f0-aa17-8b41532e6263", "type": "topic", "title": "Evaluation, Data, and Learning for Macro Practice", "description": "Use proportionate, ethical evaluation to improve community and organizational work and demonstrate accountability.", "children": [{"id": "ae6245d6-cfd0-47ab-ab2f-b5a01aa70a82", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evaluation questions and design", "children": [{"id": "4149c126-cac8-464c-b483-6b32dbcf2394", "type": "concept", "title": "Process, outcome, impact, developmental, and participatory evaluation"}, {"id": "c89bc880-3391-44de-93d